Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the rain no longer falls, and I\Nsee the sky, I think the rain is falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to when I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could only cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Blindly chasing after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell far behind my only thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,One day I will be stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.42,0:00:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bridget and gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fading with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I stronger now than I was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:00:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as weak as back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:01:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But until I do, my voyage will not end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's next, I'm\Nwalking straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.94,0:01:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go, there's nothing\Nthat can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's on our side,\Nwe'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall, but we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.66,0:01:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything will take\Nwhat I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The voices inside me push\Nme to keep surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on, I'll get through,\Nno matter what I gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiercest of all can pour upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care why in the\Nworld would I turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's not on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.26,0:02:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.04,0:02:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll always keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Will take what I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the future's there for us to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.96,0:02:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,living dangerously is one\Nthing living carelessly
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,another if i'd lack the foresight to bring
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.06,0:02:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,an antidote i'd be\Nstumbling over your corpses
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:03:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,right now don't ever\Nunderestimate magellan
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.30,0:03:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but we're here you shouldn't dismiss your
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,own inclusion your\Npresence is a factor in our
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate as well, though\Nhe's right. I was sure I.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.74,0:03:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,was a dead man we're lucky\Nwe're all still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.38,0:03:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,well it ain't up to us whether we'll ever
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,die fear of death is\Nthe fastest way to lose
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.14,0:03:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,just live what you can\Neven if it kills you right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,still don't think i ain't\Ngrateful for your help because
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.34,0:03:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,i am and again welcome to our\Ngame i bet we'll make a great
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.98,0:04:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,team i don't see much future\Nfor myself in this Carrot you're
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,exactly the sort of person i've\Nwanted to meet for some time
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.14,0:04:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we'll have to do\Nwithout Inazuma from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you trying to tell us\Nthe infection is that serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I was lucky that Magellan hit\Nme with only one type of poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.72,0:04:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to flush it out of my system\Nusing my healing and energy hormones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an ambivalent fix\Nthough one hormone will
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,take years off my life while\Nthe other causes severe
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,side effects so for him\Nthe best thing possible is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,good old-fashioned bed rest\Nand natural rehabilitation
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing can help you to\Nregain the years lost
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,By using the hormone\NInazuma, is an indispensable
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.38,0:04:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,newcomer of the revolutionary\Narmy we need him healthy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,so we have to make sure\Nhe recovers slow and easy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.70,0:05:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it He wasn't\Nsuch a pain in the butt after all
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He was such a good guy.\NAnd he got God saving us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.46,0:05:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sad, Nobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't waste your whole lives mourning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He was great, but now he's\Ndead, and that's the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.74,0:05:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So all he can do is party.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.96,0:05:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what he would want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It can double as a funeral for Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.96,0:05:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the truth if you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.63,0:06:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,for all we know, there's still a chance\NBond didn't even get killed, you big nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, what did you just say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a big stupid nose to go\Nalong with your big stupid face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.58,0:06:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How about I stretch your\Nstupid face until it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.46,0:06:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, blow it out your giant nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.18,0:06:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, they both look like idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fancy trick! How you rallied those\Nsharks? How'd you do it? I was under.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the impression only mermaids have\Nthe ability to speak to fish but that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,impression is clearly incorrect is\Nthat odd a fish man being friends
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,with fish well it's not the usual i\Nknow that you're a strange one huh
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.46,0:06:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The misfit of the savage species. Fine,\NI'll take that as a compliment of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.06,0:07:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes it's true Fishmen do have a violent\Nnature Vaughn is not dead, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.86,0:07:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy threw another big red nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be here if it weren't for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.30,0:07:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me the chance to rescue Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.54,0:07:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And I owe you a great debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.26,0:07:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think about it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We're even.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, you're super strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just happy to have you on the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.28,0:07:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could thank him\Nproperly and apologize
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,for my involvement in that\Nunfortunate situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.28,0:07:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But no, this isn't the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We have enough to worry about for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.26,0:07:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I only hope my strength will be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.28,0:07:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be one of the seven warlords, but\Nthey'll strip me of my title after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's make Navy Headquarters\Nregret the ever-laid hands on Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We must do right by our fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.48,0:07:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make your friend proud\Nand rescue Ace at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.10,0:07:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Warlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.01,0:08:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Navy Headquarters?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.74,0:08:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.86,0:08:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're seriously a warlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.14,0:08:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, no wonder you're so strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I suppose I should\Nhave told you sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.02,0:08:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody else knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.49,0:08:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all this talk\Nabout Navy Headquarters?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.48,0:08:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me we escaped\Nfrom the bowels of hell
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,just to head straight back\Ninto the jaws of the beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.98,0:08:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody is that crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.56,0:08:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you guys heard about the war\Nbrewing between Whitebeard and the Navy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, war?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.68,0:08:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Navy Headquarters?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act like it's a big surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.58,0:08:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Not our fault you're so dense. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we passed through the gate\Nof justice, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Our destination is Eni's lobby or Navy HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.28,0:08:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This tub current is restricted\Nto government passage only.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.64,0:08:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one giant whirlpool that connects\Nthe government's three major facilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason we bust it out now is because\Nwe have a role to play in this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.54,0:08:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So you best get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the real fight's about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Real fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do you call it back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.58,0:09:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.58,0:09:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No one told us about this! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.30,0:09:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn this ship around, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no stopping, and\Nthere's no turning around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not while the ship's on the current.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're scared, just get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.74,0:09:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't do that, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That would kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.32,0:09:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We both have Garp power!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe HQ, the warlords?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.96,0:09:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Whitebeard pirates all\Nfighting each other at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody can survive that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.10,0:09:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.20,0:09:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather be in prison than this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.40,0:09:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us from New Common\NLand knew about this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.30,0:09:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why the hell didn't you tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just how I know what's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Click.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He answered it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings from Navy HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.88,0:10:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, move here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.62,0:10:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot, don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.44,0:10:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, kid, we're aware that the\Nship has been hijacked by escapees.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.18,0:10:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We received a report from Impel\NDown, so let's be honest here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.14,0:10:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Before contact was lost, we had\Ninsider information being fed to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.72,0:10:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on this, we've determined who the\Ntwo ringleaders behind the breakout are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.54,0:10:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Two?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You, the pirate known as Straw Hat\NLuffy, and another notorious pirate,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.78,0:11:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy the Clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.68,0:11:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what? Ringleader? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got warlords here, and their\Nmain suspect is Captain Buggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.06,0:11:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come clean with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.04,0:11:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass me the documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.75,0:11:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.67,0:11:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, we just assumed that the\Nclown was another two-bit criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.32,0:11:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But to be frank, we were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We learned he was a crew member on the ship\Nof Gold Roger, King of the Pirates. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.92,0:11:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They found me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.54,0:11:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You brutal me, Liar Jackson! Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.34,0:11:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a star!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.36,0:11:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A star among pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.98,0:11:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and there's one other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.78,0:11:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an ally of one of the four emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.22,0:11:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Red-Haired Shanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.10,0:11:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.01,0:11:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,if you can hear us, Buggy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.34,0:11:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,we don't know how someone with your\Nbackground has laid low for so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.14,0:12:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but you most certainly stepped\Ninto the spotlight now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.98,0:12:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.02,0:12:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't defined your\Nconnection with Firefist Ace yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but we're sure you share the\Nsame goal with Straw Hat Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,to rescue him from execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.82,0:12:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We know that you're accompanied\Nby Jinbe, Crocodile, Ivankov.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the more\Nthan 200 average run-of
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.24,0:12:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-the-mill ruffians you tricked\Ninto following your lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let me explain your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.38,0:12:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fates depend on whether\Nwe open the gate of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.72,0:12:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we leave it closed,\Nyou can't get to Marine Corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.06,0:12:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can't even get\Nout of the tub current.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be completely stranded.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no sea for you to escape to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.72,0:12:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Better get used to your surroundings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.90,0:12:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.81,0:12:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Navy! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.04,0:12:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna rescue Ace no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.62,0:12:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Better keep your potatoes peeled!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.10,0:13:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.01,0:13:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The things keep your eyes peeled!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm gonna be craving potatoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.10,0:13:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He just tried to pick\Na fight with Navy HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.12,0:13:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget the potatoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.56,0:13:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I've gotta know, Captain Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.16,0:13:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you honestly a member\Nof Goldraunch's crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.68,0:13:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And a sworn brother of red-haired shanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have said, you're one\Nhell of a pirate, Captain Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.38,0:13:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.60,0:13:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The government's not going to let me out\Nof their sights now that the truth's out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the background I\Nwas expecting from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.16,0:13:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet he's so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.28,0:13:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That pedigree?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.50,0:13:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's so petty?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.86,0:13:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Every ship has one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A little blemish, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth. You know,\Nactually, perhaps you've
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.06,0:13:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,heard of a pirate named\NBuggy from the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The old vice captain\Nguy said something about
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you the vice captain yeah\Nthe old guy Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You know him right do I\Nare you saying that you've
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.32,0:14:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,actually seen Rayleigh\Noh man I miss that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.14,0:14:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They're talking about Dark King Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.84,0:14:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Like it's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.48,0:14:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, Captain Boogie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you were the genuine article.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.70,0:14:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, look, not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.64,0:14:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is true, yes, but you can't\Ngo spreading this around willy-nilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.78,0:14:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta think about\Nmy future as a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.42,0:14:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I can't believe you're a\Nmember of such a legendary crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Boogie, Boogie, Boogie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen to me, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Boogie, Boogie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.14,0:14:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.44,0:14:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was an apprentice, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.60,0:14:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't worship me for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.44,0:14:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.82,0:14:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not being humble, just stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.66,0:15:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel as bad as I thought I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.82,0:15:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, the Navy has\Ncompletely overestimated me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.68,0:15:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but maybe that's not such a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.74,0:15:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.74,0:15:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because it's all true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.56,0:15:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a pretty good\Nreputation going for me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.32,0:15:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If only there was some way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.48,0:15:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could defeat Whitebeard, maybe I\Ncould become one of the four emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I would need to become\Nthe king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.16,0:15:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of these guys have probably got\Nhigher bounties on their heads than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If I play my cards just right,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.92,0:15:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.26,0:15:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy, we'll follow\Nyou until the day we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.14,0:15:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give us an order, like steal\Nthis ship from the guys who stole it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have to go to Navy HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.34,0:15:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. And then we'll be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:16:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to do it, Straw Hat, but\Nwe're taking control of this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.04,0:16:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We already broke out of prison, and we\Ndon't want dying to be the next thing we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.26,0:16:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.50,0:16:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got Captain Buggy on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.54,0:16:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him, Captain Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.92,0:16:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.26,0:16:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one way to handle this. Kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. I've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.48,0:16:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I really think I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.46,0:16:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get too flashy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are high on power\Nand acting impulsively!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.28,0:16:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, this ship's not stopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're headed straight\Nfor the heart of the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.54,0:16:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And you guys are already\Non board, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.08,0:16:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about what that means for a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.34,0:16:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In no time at all, we'll\Ncome face to face with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:17:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,a man standing With his\Nfoot on top of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Chances like this don't come\Naround More than once in a lifetime
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So listen I want all of you to\Nlive out a dream With me for today
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll conquer Whitebeard and\Nthus rule the world. Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.18,0:17:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.20,0:17:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. The darkness of hell\Nhad beaten us down. You saved
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.38,0:17:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,us Gave us light We almost lost\Nthe most important thing Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.98,0:17:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Our dreams. You fled us. Dream\Nagain. I'll follow you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy To hell with\Nliving a peaceful life
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.52,0:17:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right then, now let's win\Nthis war, you guys, to Navy HQ!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.08,0:17:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guess the mutiny's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.54,0:18:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he's not entirely useless, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.26,0:18:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna rule the world, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.12,0:18:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with you to the bitter end!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.40,0:18:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! You are!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them have fun while they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.56,0:18:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,On the island of Marineford,\Nhome of Navy headquarters,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.20,0:18:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,there lies a large city primarily\Npopulated by Navy families, but not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,For their safety, an evacuation order\Nhas been issued to all residents.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.84,0:18:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,At the evacuation site on the Sabo\NOdi archipelago, that has placed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.72,0:18:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,residents anxiously wait to view\Nthe execution on giant monitors
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.48,0:19:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Journalists and cameramen from\Nacross the world have also gathered
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.06,0:19:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,here To break the news of the\Nproceedings as quickly as they unfold
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez the navy's really\Nnot messing around that's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.16,0:19:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The best they've got.\NYeah, Whitebeard's gotta
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.32,0:19:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,know what's in store\Nso the question is does
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.24,0:19:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,he want to Risk it every\Nlookout ship the navy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,has sent out in search\Nof Whitebeard has Been
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.52,0:19:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,swiftly sunk and yet there\Nhave been no sightings
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.64,0:19:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,of the pirate himself\NThe tension looming of
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.04,0:19:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,a Marineford rises with\Neach passing second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Start climbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to live life,\Nand that's without any regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.28,0:20:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.10,0:21:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday, we're going to head out to sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.28,0:21:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and live the way we want to\Nlive, more free than anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.90,0:21:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You think Whitebeard's gotten there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.98,0:21:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There are only three hours left now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.10,0:21:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Meh, I'm starting to wonder if\Nhe's going to show up at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the guy's serious news, but\Nisn't he a little bit too old for a war?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.42,0:21:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, you really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.26,0:21:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been tearing up the sea\Nsince before the Great Pirate era.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.70,0:22:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do the math, he's got to be senile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.64,0:22:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's been a few years now\Nsince his name made any headlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all fools for\Ntaking this so lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.96,0:22:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard's living in a\Ncompletely different era now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he stand a chance,\Ntaking on the entire Navy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.74,0:22:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bound to be a colossal\Nmassacre, no matter who wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.90,0:22:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope he doesn't show.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.70,0:22:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The execution would happen, but\None death is better than thousands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.10,0:22:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to open the\Nbar on a day like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.00,0:22:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world's about to\Ngo to war any minute now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.94,0:22:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.34,0:22:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll open up tomorrow if\Nwe're all still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.92,0:22:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And some bottles to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.90,0:22:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for you to treat\Nus like we're on the execution block.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.28,0:23:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You expect us to live without drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.58,0:23:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone talks like he's just some old\Nman, but we all know it ain't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.86,0:23:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How long has it been now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.60,0:23:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't have been more\Nthan a year since he
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.32,0:23:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,walked in here and sat\Nright there across from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.08,0:23:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We all thought we were dead men.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.30,0:23:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Whitebeard really as nefarious\Nas everyone makes him out to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.60,0:23:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.54,0:23:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even those kids know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.86,0:23:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just listen to their little song.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.02,0:23:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,White beer, white beer,\Nhe's so mean, he's so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.18,0:23:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lord, I'm so afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.78,0:23:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is this world headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.72,0:23:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help us through these awful times.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.80,0:24:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Get those in place!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.52,0:24:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You, pick up the pace, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.08,0:24:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.32,0:24:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what we face,\Nit'll only last three hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.60,0:24:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, it's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.26,0:24:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy has summoned its most elite\Nsoldiers from all over the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.68,0:24:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,totaling almost 100,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.16,0:24:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,With a focus on the\Ncrescent-shaped Bay Area,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.98,0:24:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the island is protected\Nby 50 Navy warships.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.18,0:24:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.54,0:24:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the surrounding walls have been armed\Nwith a countless number of cannons
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.94,0:24:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and positioned front and center before\Nthe vast throng of marshaled forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.20,0:25:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand five of the Navy's\Nmost ferocious allies,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.86,0:25:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the seven warlords of\Nthe sea, closely guarding
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.38,0:25:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the scaffold from the\Nfoot of the structure,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.32,0:25:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,both revered and feared, the three marine?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.76,0:25:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,admirals.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.20,0:25:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,On this day,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.44,0:25:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,every force of order the world government\Ncan gather has been unified to stand
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.08,0:25:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Against the Whitebeard pirates in\Nimminent battle over the life of one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.64,0:26:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see it! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.02,0:26:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Jibay!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.30,0:26:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Gate of Justice! We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.18,0:26:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It was really fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.84,0:26:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It should have been faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.74,0:26:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We would have arrived a lot sooner\Nif the winds had been right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.12,0:26:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The question now is how we're\Nsupposed to get through the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.18,0:26:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, men, you know what time it is? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.26,0:26:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me hear it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.80,0:26:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Captain Zoro\Nto cover the entire world!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.92,0:26:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And let me hear the rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.02,0:26:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe HQ's going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.20,0:26:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.60,0:26:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bringing out Firefist Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.10,0:26:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, so that's him. He\Nlooks just like anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.00,0:26:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,else but every step he\Ntakes could throw all of
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.24,0:26:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,us into an unthinkable
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.26,0:27:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,war alive or dead he's
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.14,0:27:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,responsible for our fates\Nand the whole worlds?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.30,0:27:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Gar, I'll do the talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.40,0:27:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.50,0:27:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.66,0:27:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside for a minute yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.72,0:27:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the fleet admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.62,0:27:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing? Pass me a snail, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.24,0:28:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have some information\Nyou all need to hear
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.94,0:28:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This man is Portgas D. Ace,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.38,0:28:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and the significance of his impending demise\Nis more profound than you may realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.50,0:28:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,None of this is your fault, Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.14,0:28:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't hold back those motherly\Nfeelings during dark time, Tsuru.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.88,0:28:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace, I would like you to tell\Nthem the name of your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.28,0:28:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,his father what's that\Nhave to do with anything
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.32,0:28:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the name of my father is whitebeard not\Ntrue yes it is whitebeard is my father
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.46,0:28:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,my only father we launched a painstaking\Nand exhaustive search for you around the
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.76,0:29:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,time of your birth when we heard rumors\Nthat your father had a child we took them
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.18,0:29:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,very seriously thanks to Cipher pole a\Nsmall but reliable amount of information was
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.84,0:29:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,presented to us based on this we checked\Nall newborns as well as all pre-born
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.80,0:29:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,children we spoke to many mothers but no
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.40,0:29:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,matter how far and wide\Nwe searched we couldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.20,0:29:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,find you no surprise\Nthough especially when
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.52,0:29:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,you consider the lengths your mother went
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.18,0:29:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,to to hide you she performed a miracle that\Ncan only come from the love of a mother
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.70,0:29:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result, she misled the navy.\NNo, she managed to mislead the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.74,0:29:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You come from an island in\Nthe south blue called Badalina
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.40,0:29:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And your mother's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.50,0:29:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Portgas de Rouge
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.28,0:29:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She pulled off a feat that\Ncompletely defied the laws of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.40,0:29:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All to protect her child!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.06,0:30:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She kept her baby inside her\Nwomb for an entire 20 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.04,0:30:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.08,0:30:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And once she finally gave birth to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.88,0:30:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,she lost all of her strength and\Npassed away right then and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.20,0:30:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus, a year and three months\Nafter the death of his father,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.34,0:30:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,a child was born with the blood of the\Nworld's most odious villain in his veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.18,0:30:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That child was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.12,0:30:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you must know the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.40,0:30:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't persecute someone\Nwho's yet to be born.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.44,0:30:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Garp?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.98,0:30:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So please look after my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.70,0:30:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a true father!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.02,0:31:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Gold Roger the King of the Pirates?
